WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.490
Eight years along the Ystad coast. Repeated satellite images let researchers compare mapped shoreline positions.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:15.010
An index method and a neural network produce alternative coastal segmentations.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:21.410
The coloured lines compare shoreline estimates from 2018–2025.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:31.450
Water level, waves and method uncertainty also affect mapped positions. Confirm erosion with additional evidence.
